--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7e99d2aa6db43f2478d3198a0ca05313, type: 3}
  m_Name: BunDau_after_visual_scan
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueInfo:
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dcbb5bf5c792b71498b2fb1c38ad7fd7, type: 2}
    charText: The dip is the first thing that catches my eye.
    characterEmotion: 0
    continueCheck: 0
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dcbb5bf5c792b71498b2fb1c38ad7fd7, type: 2}
    charText: That deep purple-brown color has a heavy fermented pull before I even
      taste it.
    characterEmotion: 0
    continueCheck: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dcbb5bf5c792b71498b2fb1c38ad7fd7, type: 2}
    charText: The foam on top looks strong too, almost too aggressive for the rest
      of the platter.
    characterEmotion: 0
    continueCheck: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dcbb5bf5c792b71498b2fb1c38ad7fd7, type: 2}
    charText: Visually, it promises depth, but also a sharp briny edge.
    characterEmotion: 0
    continueCheck: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dcbb5bf5c792b71498b2fb1c38ad7fd7, type: 2}
    charText: The tofu and toppings look clean enough, but the dip is clearly controlling
      the plate.
    characterEmotion: 0
    continueCheck: 0
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dcbb5bf5c792b71498b2fb1c38ad7fd7, type: 2}
    charText: So the first impression is powerful, maybe a little unbalanced.
    characterEmotion: 0
    continueCheck: 1
